JSON values, typed decision contracts, HTTP framing and Apple generation schema
conversion were extracted and adapted from Seven, authored by Luca Silverentand.

Apple Foundation Models is a system framework, not distributed with this project.
Ollama and model weights are separately installed operator-provided components;
their respective licenses continue to apply. This repository contains no generative-model
weights, Ollama binaries, account credentials or private Seven state.

Local audio is separately installed from MLX-Audio (MIT), Whisper Large V3 Turbo
(MIT), Chatterbox Multilingual (MIT), S3TokenizerV2 and the upstream Chatterbox
packaged default voice conditioning. Their upstream licenses and model cards
apply. The repository contains download manifests and a hashed Python dependency
lock, not their binaries or weights. Installed Python packages retain their own
license metadata. See Resources/Audio/README.md for pinned provenance.

Local microphone cleanup bundles SpeexDSP 1.2.1 and RNNoise 0.1.1 under their
BSD-style licenses. RNNoise includes its small original embedded denoising network.
Their full copyright/license notices are in ThirdParty/SpeexDSP/NOTICES and
ThirdParty/RNNoise/NOTICES and are copied into the app resources. See
ThirdParty/README.md for immutable source provenance and build configuration.
